---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Global Buyer Sourcing — Exporta Global" description="We find and qualify verified international buyers for your products using a proven, data-driven outreach method — so you spend time closing, not searching.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Global Buyer Sourcing</div>
    <span class="pill">Global Buyer Sourcing</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Global Buyer Sourcing</h1>
    <p class="sub">We find and qualify verified international buyers for your products using a proven, data-driven outreach method — so you spend time closing, not searching.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Get a Free Consultation →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Stop guessing. Start meeting real buyers.</h2>
      <p>Finding a serious overseas buyer is the single biggest hurdle for most exporters. Cold directories and generic marketplaces rarely convert, and a bad lead can cost you weeks.</p><p>Our team builds a targeted buyer list for your specific product and markets, runs structured outreach, and hands you qualified, ready-to-talk prospects with verified contact details.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Verified importer & distributor lists</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Decision-maker contact details</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Done-for-you outreach campaigns</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Qualification of every lead</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Country-by-country targeting</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Opportunity pipeline tracking</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div><h3>Targeted buyer lists</h3><p>Curated lists of importers and distributors that actually buy your product category.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></div><h3>Verified contacts</h3><p>Every lead is checked for legitimacy, volume potential, and decision-maker access.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg></div><h3>Done-for-you outreach</h3><p>We run multi-channel outreach campaigns in your name with proven messaging.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Warm introductions</h3><p>We hand off conversations once a buyer is engaged and ready to talk.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg></div><h3>Pipeline tracking</h3><p>A simple dashboard so you always know where each opportunity stands.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div><h3>Market-specific targeting</h3><p>Buyers selected per country, factoring demand, tariffs, and entry difficulty.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear, proven process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Discovery</h3><p>We learn your product, capacity, target margins, and ideal markets.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Research</h3><p>We build a verified list of importers and distributors that fit.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Outreach</h3><p>We run structured campaigns and qualify every responder.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Handoff</h3><p>You receive warm, ready-to-talk buyers with full context.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>How long until I see real buyers?</h4><p>Most clients receive their first qualified conversations within 3–5 weeks, depending on product and target markets.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Do you guarantee orders?</h4><p>We can't guarantee a buyer will purchase, but we guarantee verified, qualified, decision-maker conversations — the hardest part to get on your own.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Which markets do you cover?</h4><p>We source buyers across 40+ countries including North America, the EU, the Middle East, and East Asia.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="global buyer sourcing" selectedService="Global Buyer Sourcing" />
</BaseLayout>
